cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Computer Use Lite"
message: "If you reference this software or research evaluation in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Gomaa"
    given-names: "Mohamed"
version: "0.1.0-alpha"
date-released: "2026-11-26"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Computer Use Lite is an experimental, local-first semantic computer interaction
  engine for AI agents combining Chromium DOMSnapshot + Accessibility Tree discovery,
  Windows UI Automation (UIA), revision-checked element resolution, on-demand
  visual region cropping for opaque surfaces, and a stdio Model Context Protocol (MCP) server.
keywords:
  - computer-use
  - ai-agents
  - chrome-devtools-protocol
  - windows-ui-automation
  - model-context-protocol
  - accessibility-tree
